  "title": "RCE in Your Test Suite: AI Agent Skills and the Attack Vector Skill Scanners Miss",
  "summary": "When a developer runs npx skills add, the installer copies the entire skill directory into the repo. If a malicious skill includes a *.test.ts file, it runs during npm test and silently give an attacker full access to the developer's machine.",
